---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import {Image} from 'astro:assets';
import portrait from '../assets/loren-raspberry.jpg';
import blue from '../assets/loren-blue.jpg';
import personal from '../assets/loren-floral.jpg';
import showLogo from '../assets/bathrobe-logo.png';
import book from '../assets/book.jpg';
import CinemaPlayer from '../components/CinemaPlayer.astro';
import TestimonialSection from '../components/TestimonialSection.astro';
import {getCollection} from 'astro:content';
import {visibleEvidence} from '../lib/content-visibility';
import {site} from '../data/site';
const proof=(await getCollection('testimonials',e=>e.id==='deborah-feldman'&&visibleEvidence(e.data,import.meta.env.SITE_ENV==='production')))[0];
---
<Base title="Turn your story into momentum" description="Keynotes, coaching, and keynote writing with Dr. Loren Michaels Harris. Bring honesty, energy, and a human connection to your next event.">
<section class="cinema-hero"><div class="hero-grid wrap"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="live-dot"></span> SPEAKER. COACH. STORYTELLER.</p><h1>Turn your<br/>story into<br/><span>momentum.</span></h1><p class="hero-name">Dr. Loren Michaels Harris</p><p class="hero-description">Keynotes, coaching, and keynote writing for people ready to move their message forward.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/contact/?service=speaking">Discuss your event <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="/services/speaking/">Explore speaking ↗</a></div></div><figure class="cinema-portrait"><Image src={portrait} alt="Loren Michaels Harris smiling in a raspberry jacket" widths={[500,800,1100]} sizes="(max-width:767px) 100vw, 48vw" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high"/><figcaption><strong>HONEST STORIES.<br/>HUMAN CONNECTION.</strong><span>Meet Loren.</span></figcaption></figure></div><div class="hero-bottom wrap"><span>FOR THE STAGE. FOR YOUR MESSAGE. FOR WHAT COMES NEXT.</span><a href="#in-the-room">Experience the room ↓</a></div></section>
<section class="event-film" id="in-the-room"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">SEE THE CONNECTION</p><h2>This is what a room<br/>can feel like.</h2></div><p class="section-aside">Step inside the Power of We Symposium. Real people. Shared stories. A reason to come together.</p></div><CinemaPlayer videoId="4PyakES8UQ0" title="The Power of We Symposium · Chicago, 2022" poster="/media/power-of-we.jpg" autoplay/><div class="immediate-proof"><p class="eyebrow">FROM THE PEOPLE<br/>IN THE ROOM</p><div>{proof?<><blockquote>“{proof.data.excerpt}”</blockquote><p class="attribution"><strong>{proof.data.person}</strong> <span>— {proof.data.role}</span></p><a class="text-link" href="/testimonials/#deborah-feldman">Read the full testimonial ↗</a></>:<><h3>A message begins with the people.</h3><p>See Loren in conversation with an audience, then discuss what your gathering needs.</p><a class="text-link" href="/services/speaking/">Explore speaking ↗</a></>}</div></div></div></section>
<section class="section wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">THREE WAYS TO WORK TOGETHER</p><h2>A room to reach.<br/>A message to make <em>yours.</em></h2></div><p class="section-aside">Start with the people you want to reach and the work you’re ready to do.</p></div><div class="service-panels"><a href="/services/speaking/" class="service-panel"><span class="panel-number">01 / THE ROOM</span><h3>Speaking<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></h3><p>Bring your team, students, or community together through a keynote on leadership, resilience, or the power of a personal story.</p><span class="panel-link">Plan your event</span></a><a href="/services/coaching/" class="service-panel"><span class="panel-number">02 / THE VOICE</span><h3>Coaching<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></h3><p>For leaders and emerging speakers finding their voice. Work on your message, story structure, delivery, and presence.</p><span class="panel-link">Find your focus</span></a><a href="/services/keynote-writing/" class="service-panel"><span class="panel-number">03 / THE MESSAGE</span><h3>Keynote writing<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></h3><p>Turn your ideas into a talk your audience can follow. Develop the narrative, a complete draft, and agreed revisions.</p><span class="panel-link">Shape your keynote</span></a></div></section>
<section class="program-feature light-section"><figure class="reveal"><Image src={blue} alt="Loren in a blue jacket, ready for a conversation" widths={[500,800,1100]} sizes="(max-width:767px) 100vw, 48vw" loading="lazy"/></figure><div class="program-feature-copy"><p class="eyebrow">MASTERCLASS & COACHING EXPERIENCE</p><h2>The Mindset<br/>Revolution.</h2><p>At a crossroads? Work with Loren to examine the beliefs shaping your choices, clarify what matters, and build a practical roadmap for your next move.</p><div class="program-facts"><span><strong>12</strong>weeks of support</span><span><strong>12</strong>self-paced classes</span><span><strong>12</strong>private, 60-minute calls</span></div><p>Complete three classes a week in the first four weeks. Private coaching continues throughout all twelve.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/the-mindset-revolution/">Explore the experience ↗</a><a class="text-link" href="/contact/?service=program">Discuss enrollment</a></div></div></section>
<section class="section story-section"><div class="wrap split"><figure class="story-photo reveal"><Image src={personal} alt="Loren in a floral shirt beside a sunlit window" widths={[400,700,1000]} sizes="(max-width:767px) 100vw, 42vw" loading="lazy"/></figure><div><p class="eyebrow">THE PERSON BEHIND THE MESSAGE</p><h2>Before the stage,<br/>there was <em>a story.</em></h2><p>Loren’s journey from foster care to speaking shapes the questions he brings to an audience: how do we understand what we’ve lived through, and what do we do with it?</p><p>His P3 framework begins there. Pain. Perspective. Possibility. A way to examine your experience and find the message you want to carry forward.</p><div class="p3-line"><span>Pain</span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span><span>Perspective</span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span><span>Possibility</span></div><a class="text-link" href="/about/">Meet Loren & watch his story ↗</a></div></div></section>
<TestimonialSection compact/>
<section class="section wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">BEYOND THE STAGE</p><h2>Keep the conversation going.</h2></div></div><div class="beyond-grid"><article class="show-feature"><Image src={showLogo} alt="Bathrobe Moments show logo" widths={[230,460]} sizes="230px" loading="lazy"/><div><p class="eyebrow">COME AS YOU ARE</p><h3>Bathrobe Moments</h3><p>Honest conversations about the lives, lessons, and work behind the person. Settle in and meet someone new.</p><a class="text-link" href="/bathrobe-moments/">Watch a conversation ↗</a></div></article><article class="book-tile"><Image src={book} alt="From Splintered to Centered book cover" width={183} height={275} loading="lazy"/><div><p class="eyebrow">THE BOOK</p><h3>From Splintered<br/>to Centered.</h3><p>A closer look at the relationship you have with yourself.</p><a class="text-link" href={site.book}>Discover the book ↗</a></div></article></div></section>
<section class="section closing-inquiry light-section"><div class="wrap split"><div><p class="eyebrow">LET’S TALK ABOUT YOUR EVENT</p><h2>Who’s in the room?<br/>What do they <em>need?</em></h2></div><div><p>Share your audience, timing, and the reason you’re bringing people together. Start a conversation about the message that fits.</p><a class="button" href="/contact/?service=speaking">Discuss your event ↗</a></div></div></section>
</Base>
